{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme is based on the Wireframe theme (which is dedicated to mockups and prototypes)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is possible to override the semantic tokens of colors, change the default border radius and choose the font family to apply."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme, as a child of Wireframe theme does not embed by default charts colors nor decorative colors yet, but they can be defined."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme","text":"How to use the theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly. To use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" for your root view and give it an instance of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Keep in mind the themes are "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift class objects"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: WhiteLabelTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get OUDS environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Typography","text":"Typography"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme uses the native system font family by default, but it can be defined otherwise."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will need to add to define the font family parameter of the theme."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Font family name fo which resources should be loaded and used then","let fontFamily = \"Winky Rough\" ","","let theme = WhiteLabelTheme(fontFamily: fontFamily)    "]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And register the fonts resources only one time:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["static var fontsAlreadyRegistered = false","","private func registerFonts() {","    if !Self.fontsAlreadyRegistered {","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Light\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.light))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.regular))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Medium\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.medium))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_SemiBold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.semibold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Bold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.bold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Black\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.black))","        ","        let fonts = yourAppBundle.urls(forResourcesWithExtension: \"ttf\", subdirectory: nil)","        fonts?.forEach {","            CTFontManagerRegisterFontsForURL($0 as CFURL, .process, nil)","        }","        Self.fontsAlreadyRegistered = true","    }    ","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The helper "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registerFont(postScript:forCombination:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is an OUDS helper which will define the relationship between the font fmaily you use with a weight in one side, and the PostScript identifier of the font defined in the TTF in the other side."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-enrich-the-theme","text":"How to enrich the theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Today for White Label theme only the colors, the font family and the tunning can be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default nor the Wireframe theme nor the White Label theme have colors decorative and color charts tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you want to define them you will have to define your own tokens providers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme uses the other tokens of colors of Wireframe theme; you can subclass it for your needs in you want."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class MyColorTokensProvider: WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider {","","    \/\/ Give the values you want to the tokens you want","    \/\/ Some tokens have only one value...","    @objc override var repositoryInfoLow: ColorSemanticToken { ColorRawTokens.functionalSun200 }","    @objc override var repositoryInfoHighest: ColorSemanticToken { ColorRawTokens.functionalSun800 }","    ","    \/\/ ...and other tokens can have a pair of values, for light and dark modes","    @objc override var surfaceBrandPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken { MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: repositoryInfoLow, dark: repositoryInfoHighest) }","}    "]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"How-it-looks-like","text":"How it looks like"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To test your own White Label theme implementation, you can use for example the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add you own implementation for the tokens of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox\/blob\/develop\/DesignToolbox\/DesignToolbox\/White%20Label%20Example\/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then build and run the app and enjoy!"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["","\/\/ MARK: - Borders","","class DesignToolboxBorderSemanticTokensProvider: WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider {","    ","    override open var radiusDefault: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { BorderRawTokens.radius300 }","}","","let kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelBorders = DesignToolboxBorderSemanticTokensProvider()","    ","\/\/ MARK: - Fonts","","let kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily = \"Winky Rough\"","","\/\/ To prevent to register each time the fonts and get warnings","var designToolboxWhiteLabelFontAlreadyRegistered = false","","func registerDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFonts() {","    if !designToolboxWhiteLabelFontAlreadyRegistered {","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Light\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.light))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.regular))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Medium\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.medium))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_SemiBold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.semibold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Bold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.bold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Black\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.black))","        ","        let fonts = Bundle.main.urls(forResourcesWithExtension: \"ttf\", subdirectory: nil)","        fonts?.forEach {","            CTFontManagerRegisterFontsForURL($0 as CFURL, .process, nil)","        }","        ","        designToolboxWhiteLabelFontAlreadyRegistered = true","    }","}","","\/\/ MARK: - Colors (raw)","","enum DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors {","","    static let bloodRed = \"#C0392BFF\"","    static let vividRed = \"#FF6B6BFF\"","    static let concreteGrey = \"#F0F0F0FF\"","    static let nearBlack = \"#1C1C1EFF\"","    static let softGrey = \"#E0E0E0FF\"","    static let deepGrey = \"#2C2C2EFF\"","    static let mutedLight = \"#6E6E73FF\"","    static let mutedDark = \"#8E8E93FF\"","    static let borderLight = \"#D0D0D0FF\"","}","","\/\/ MARK: - Colors (semantic)","","\/\/ Override the tokens you want","class DesignToolboxColorSemanticTokensProvider: WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider {","","       override open var bgPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.concreteGrey, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.nearBlack)","       }","","       override open var bgSecondary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.softGrey, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.deepGrey)","       }","","       override open var contentDefault: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.nearBlack, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.concreteGrey)","       }","","       override open var contentMuted: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.mutedLight, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.mutedDark)","       }","","       override open var contentBrandPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.bloodRed, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.vividRed)","       }","","       override open var actionEnabled: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.bloodRed, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.vividRed)","       }","","       override open var borderBrandPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.bloodRed, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.vividRed)","       }","}","","let kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelColors = DesignToolboxColorSemanticTokensProvider()","","\/\/ MARK: - Theme instanciation","","let myDesignToolboxWhiteLabelTheme = WhiteLabelTheme(borders: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelBorders,","                                                     colors: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelColors,","                                                     name: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelName,","                                                     fontFamily: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily)","","\/\/ MARK: - Inject the theme","","var body: some View {","    OUDSThemeableView(theme: myDesignToolboxWhiteLabelTheme) {","        YourAppContent()","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme White Label"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Library","symbolKind":"module","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Theme White Label"}],"title":"Theme White Label","externalID":"OUDSThemesWhiteLabel","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_whitelabel.png"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Group","anchor":"Group","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme"]},{"title":"Classes","generated":true,"anchor":"Classes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"]},{"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/SwiftUICore"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This White Label theme is a specific theme. It has been designed to let users have their own theme to update like a grey label theme, or to keep as is like a white label theme."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox/blob/develop/DesignToolbox/DesignToolbox/White%20Label%20Example/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift":{"title":"White Label Theme Example","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox\/blob\/develop\/DesignToolbox\/DesignToolbox\/White%20Label%20Example\/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox\/blob\/develop\/DesignToolbox\/DesignToolbox\/White%20Label%20Example\/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"White Label Theme Example"}]},"ic_theme_whitelabel.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_whitelabel.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/ic_theme_whitelabel.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel","title":"Theme White Label","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Theme White Label"}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_whitelabel.png","type":"icon"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This White Label theme is a specific theme. It has been designed to let users have their own theme to update like a grey label theme, or to keep as is like a white label theme."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/whitelabelthemebordersemantictokensprovider","title":"WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"border semantic tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and expose them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/whitelabelthemecolorsemantictokensprovider","title":"WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"color semantic tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"multiple"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or not, and expose them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/WhiteLabelTheme":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/whitelabeltheme","title":"WhiteLabelTheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelTheme"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelTheme"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This White Label theme is a specific theme. It has been designed to let users have their own theme to update like a grey label theme, or to keep as is like a white label theme."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/SwiftUICore":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/swiftuicore","title":"SwiftUICore","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/SwiftUICore","abstract":[]},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox":{"title":"Design System Toolbox application","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Design System Toolbox application"}]}}}